msgid "当前架构图册"
msgstr "Current architecture diagrams"

msgid "图源为可编辑 DOT，输出为本地 SVG；`labels.json` 维护同一拓扑的中英文标签。 实线和虚线以各边标签为准，不能把源码依赖理解为每次 I/O 的转发，也不能由图推导 软件候选、吞吐、低功耗或物理 HIL。当前 MCU 入口为 F4，精确器件与模式见 [支持范围](../../delivery/support.md)；图中参考装配不授权其他配置。"
msgstr "Editable DOT sources produce local SVG files; `labels.json` maintains English and Chinese labels for the same topology. Edge labels define solid and dashed arrows. Source dependencies do not imply forwarding on every I/O call, and diagrams establish no software candidate, throughput, low-power or physical HIL result. The current MCU entry is F4; see [support scope](../../delivery/support.md) for exact devices and modes. A diagram reference assembly authorizes no other configuration."


msgid "纯退役芯片图已退出当前图册，原图可从 [固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/assets/diagrams) 追溯。机器身份与范围见 {download}`diagram-index.csv <diagram-index.csv>`，原始执行证据不重标。"
msgstr "Diagrams dedicated to retired chips have left the current gallery. Their originals remain traceable at the [fixed prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/assets/diagrams). Machine identities and scope are in {download}`diagram-index.csv <diagram-index.csv>`; original execution evidence is not relabeled."

msgid "修改图源或标签后，使用已准备锁定工具重新生成并验证；渲染检查不代替独立语义审查。"
msgstr "After editing sources or labels, regenerate and verify with the prepared locked tools. Render checks do not replace independent semantic review."

msgid "FIG-01 全平台分层与外部边界"
msgstr "FIG-01 Whole-platform layers and external boundaries"

msgid "平台职责与产品外置；Platform 连接静态实例与共享 C 协调器，OS 和组件可选。 逐边区分构建事实与日常调用，生成器不拥有驱动状态机。"
msgstr "Platform responsibilities and external product ownership; Platform connects static instances with the shared C coordinator, while OS and components remain optional. Edge labels distinguish build-time facts from ordinary calls. The generator does not own driver state machines."

msgid "![FIG-01：全平台分层与外部边界](platform-architecture.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-01: Platform layers and external boundaries](platform-architecture.svg)"

msgid "FIG-01：全平台分层与外部边界"
msgstr "FIG-01: Platform layers and external boundaries"

