msgid "FIG-03 配置与原子生成"
msgstr "FIG-03 Configuration and atomic generation"

msgid "包声明、Board 与 TOML 沿同一输入快照进入通用政策与具名 IR，再形成有限静态连接 和原子 bundle。包只选择 CMake 入口，CMake 拥有唯一 C 源码图；失败不继续使用旧 输出或半成品。全部箭头表示构建期数据或产物依赖。"
msgstr "Package declarations, Board and TOML pass through one input snapshot into generic policies and named IR, then form bounded static connections and an atomic bundle. A package selects the CMake entry; CMake owns the sole C source graph. Failures do not continue with stale or partial output. Every arrow denotes build-time data or artifact dependencies."

msgid "![FIG-03：配置与原子生成](configuration-generation.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-03: Configuration and atomic generation](configuration-generation.svg)"

msgid "FIG-03：配置与原子生成"
msgstr "FIG-03: Configuration and atomic generation"

msgid "{download}`可编辑 DOT <configuration-generation.dot>`。"
msgstr "{download}`Editable DOT <configuration-generation.dot>`."

