msgid "FIG-05 显式启动停机与失败撤回"
msgstr "FIG-05 Explicit start, stop and failure cleanup"

msgid "运行期由共享 C 协调器先检查上下文，再完成全部 controller 准入，之后才取得 System、共享资源与实例。共享资源／实例失败执行逆序回滚；System 启动结果分别 报告 primary、cleanup 和残效。释放失败保留具体 owner 收条与存储，不能超时强收。"
msgstr "At runtime the shared C coordinator checks context and completes every controller admission before acquiring System, shared resources and instances. Shared-resource or instance failure triggers reverse rollback. System startup separately reports primary, cleanup and retained effects. A failed release retains the concrete owner's receipts and storage; timeout cannot force reclamation."

msgid "![FIG-05：显式启动停机与失败撤回](platform-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-05: Explicit start, stop and failure rollback](platform-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "FIG-05：显式启动停机与失败撤回"
msgstr "FIG-05: Explicit start, stop and failure rollback"

