msgid "FIG-10 Source SDK独立消费"
msgstr "FIG-10 Independent Source SDK consumption"

msgid "schema3 按所选 `profile.packages` 与包导出归属收集源码，不从单个 ELF 推导 SDK。 完整 prefix 可用于公开 GPIO 首工程或已有外部工程；实际编译仍由包内 CMake 负责。 主机运行、ARM 链接与物理 HIL 分别判断，图不授予软件候选资格。"
msgstr "Schema3 collects source by selected `profile.packages` and package export ownership, rather than deriving the SDK from one ELF. The complete prefix serves the public GPIO starter or an existing external project; package CMake still owns actual compilation. Host execution, ARM linking and physical HIL are assessed separately. The diagram grants no software-candidate qualification."

