msgid "FIG-31 F4 源码归属与接口边界"
msgstr "FIG-31: F4 source ownership and interface boundaries"

msgid "包内事实、binding、Board 和 TOML 由通用配置器生成静态实例与固定连接；F4 私有 C 拥有硬件算法和官方库适配。虚线是构建／测试依赖，实线是公共 I/O 调用，不增加 运行时转发层，也不把参考模型提升为生产或实板资格。"
msgstr "The generic configuration tool turns package facts, bindings, Board and TOML into static instances and fixed connections. Private F4 C owns hardware algorithms and official SDK adaptation. Dashed edges mean build/test dependencies; solid edges mean public I/O calls. They add no runtime forwarding layer and do not promote reference models to production or physical qualification."

